le=\"font-family:宋体;\">，我们的</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">货币</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">增速也一直只有</span>8%。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\"><br/></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\"></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\">6，</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">很多基金去年涨到高位后，还都没怎么出现过像样的回调，比如富国天惠。兴全趋势等等，再直接大涨不太现实。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-galleryid=\"\" data-ratio=\"0.3933601609657948\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMPHRRr6nW9FZWvR4h2G8KSszIG21gpOEQKvm0q8C1cUatU9qkehDyxtcoVENU4WWoeXmya4whAgrg/640?wx_fmt=png\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"994\" style=\"\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\"></span><br/></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">但我会用半仓布局低估值，因为如果</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">空仓的话</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">，有几个风险。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">1，</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">单就银行保险券商而言，基本面和技术面都已经见底，</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">最差也能拿到分红的股息率</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">5%-6%</span></span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">，再跌就是跌黄金坑。不排除大盘震荡，</span></span><